  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! India-Palm Oil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the sector governance through the National Platform and Asian Sustainable Palm Oil network (ASPN) platform for coordination, cooperation and alignment with the sustainability standards on palm oil production and trade, Launch the pilot marketing of sustainable palm oil under IPOS framework in India, introduce traceability model for palm oil developed for domestically and internationally produced palm oil for India as well as Indonesia &amp; facilitate towards strengthened social criteria i.e.  strong focus on workers? rights through enhanced capacities of workers associations/unions to effectively engage in advocacy and social dialogues 
Research on health benefits of palm oil in India as well as consumers campaigns in India 
Stakeholders? endorsement for IPOS for sustainable palm oil production and trade and develop policy recommendations for sustainable palm oil</narrative>
  </description>
